---
---

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-white text-[#0E1629]">
	<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,#F8FBFF_0%,#F6F7FA_44%,#E9EEF5_100%)]"></div>
	<div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 h-28 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#F1F3F7] to-transparent"></div>

	<div class="mx-auto grid min-h-[calc(100vh-80px)] max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-4 py-18 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-14 lg:px-8 lg:py-22">
		<div class="max-w-3xl self-center">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-normal text-[#0E1629] sm:text-5xl lg:text-[3.75rem]">
				ЗЛАТ ЕООД - Промишлени металдетектори
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-[#334155]">
				Проектиране, конструиране и производство на промишлени металдетектори за производствени линии, фабрики и специализирано оборудване.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-9 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
				<a href="services" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#3353C1] px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-white shadow-sm shadow-[#93A5DF]/60 transition hover:bg-[#1440BC]">
					Вижте услугите
				</a>
				<a href="contacts" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-[#D1D5DC] bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-[#0E1629] transition hover:border-[#DBB24D] hover:text-[#1440BC]">
					Свържете се с нас
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative self-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#D1D5DC] bg-white shadow-2xl shadow-[#93A5DF]/20">
			<img class="aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover" src="images/photos/begining.jpg" alt="Промишлен металдетектор със сегментна транспортна лента" width="615" height="487" />
			<div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-[#3353C1]/88 p-5 text-white backdrop-blur-sm sm:p-6">
				<p class="text-base font-black uppercase leading-6 tracking-[0.14em] text-white sm:text-lg">Контрол на производствени линии</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-[#F8FBFF] sm:text-base">Промишлени металдетекторни системи, създадени за реални производствени условия.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
